# OpenWhisper release signing — private keys must NEVER be committed.
# See SIGNING.md for key management. The standard location is
# ~/.openwhisper/updater.key on the release manager's machine; the
# entries below are belt-and-suspenders for accidental drag-and-drop
# of a key file INTO the repo.
*.key
!**/icons/*.key
updater.key*
.openwhisper/

